// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4094813808" "There's no time to lose, {HeroName}. We know where the Hellions are preparing this Ritual of Souls. You need to get in there and put a stop to them, once and for all.<br><br><color yellow>The most important thing is to stop that ritual and rescue the citizens who were kidnapped.</color> There's one other thing I'd like you to look into."
// AcceptString :
"P3733956995" "What is it?"
// SendOffString :
"P489451111" "I'd like you to see if you can find out <color yellow>who gave them the ritual.</color> If someone's supplying the Hellions with something this dangerous, who knows who <i>else</i> they could be helping.<br><br>That's all assuming you can stop the ritual. If not, well, we'll have bigger problems on our hands than who is giving these guys rituals!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1620979852" "Stop the Ritual of Souls"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3633516741" "There's no time to lose, {HeroName}!"
// TaskTitle :
"P585749243" "<color deepskyblue>What Was Lost</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1850325952" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: Is Now Found</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1446486225" "The air in this part of the office building is filled with smoke and magic.<br><br>There's no time to lose, you need to save those people!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 0 Actor1 :
"P2954940439" "<goto Edge>"
// 4 Actor1 :
"P2400123211" "<t=4 d=4>It looks like... You're -really- taking your daughter's death hard, Statesman!"
// 4 Actor2 :
"P1029127604" "<em point>There's no where left to run, Wade! You're going to pay for what you did to Psyche and my -daughter-!"
// 0 Actor1 :
"P856364347" ""
// 4 Actor1 :
"P2343782363" "<em DarrinStandArmsBack t=4 d=4>Oh? Are you going to kill me now, Statesman?"
// 4 Actor1 :
"P2950299159" "<goto Walk t=4 d=4>Avenge the death of your daughter once and for all?"
// 0 Actor2 :
"P1007412702" "<goto Center>"
// 4 Actor2 :
"P3547385271" "<t=4 d=4>No, Wade. You're going to -rot-, and I'm going to make sure you do so until the day you -die-."
// 3 Actor2 :
"P1998476150" "<t=4 d=4>I don't kill."
// 4 Actor1 :
"P934152941" "<em DarrinLevitateCycle t=4 d=4>That's too bad, because I -do-."
// 0 Actor1 :
"P1559229745" "<goto Walk2>"
// 2 Actor2 :
"P2390172378" "AAAAAAAAGH!!"
// 4 Actor1 :
"P1777588136" "<t=4 d=4>Do you feel that, Statesman? It's the same power that killed Imperious and Romulus."
// 4 Caption :
"P3014243660" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=4 d=4><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>As we speak, your powers are being completely nullified. It should feel -quite- familiar."
// 3 Actor1 :
"P2599414622" "<t=4 d=4>Do you have any last words, before you die?"
// 1 Actor1 :
"P4056364817" "<em DarrinStandArmsBack>"
// 4 Actor2 :
"P2002933936" "<t=4 d=4>You'll never... succeed... Wade... villainy like yours... never... does...!"
// 1 Actor1 :
"P1844101675" "<em DarrinAbsorbCast t=4 d=4>-That- was it? How trite. Goodbye, Statesman, I'll use your power well!"
// 3 Actor1 :
"P833176837" "<em DarrinAbsorbCast>"
// 4 Actor2 :
"P1084161392" "AAAAAAAAHHHHH!!"
// 4 Actor1 :
"P716716940" "<t=4 d=4>You'll feel your power, your very essence being drained from you, Statesman."
// 4 Actor1 :
"P136660761" "<t=4 d=4>And that same power of yours, the power that makes you who you are..."
// 4 Actor1 :
"P3303421872" "<em DarrinHoverCycle t=4 d=4>... is being directed into me. No longer will I have to bow to the likes of your kind!"
// 4 Actor1 :
"P2143965413" "<em DarrinHoverCycle t=4 d=4>And now... goodbye, Statesman."

